{
  "schema_version": "pdd.native-source-prompt-context.v1",
  "story_path": "user_stories/lint-source-prompt-context.md",
  "synthetic": true,
  "boundary": "src/runtime-client.mjs#runCheck",
  "default_options": {
    "--lint": true,
    "--json": true
  },
  "fixture_sources": "test/fixtures/source-only-lint-cases.json#fixture_sources",
  "notes": [
    "Expected outcomes derive from Lead 10:50 policy approved by Root before code, not implementation output.",
    "Native descriptors are harness setup, not new public APIs or Runtime wire fields. Reply descriptors materialize canonical matching receipts; all observations come from the actual public boundary.",
    "For malformed/multiple/stale/unapproved variants, retain actual recognized interface blocks and return canonical errors/refusals; do not turn invalid JSON into prose.",
    "Disk replacement uses actual complete Runtime-bearing loose-prompt bytes; frozen source identity, saved classification and warning must remain unchanged.",
    "Conservative legacy controls remove or make unsupported only local classification evidence after save; the injected legacy capture control removes sources from an otherwise actual capture. No verdict-producing ports.",
    "Legacy metadata controls first use the actual new producer, then mutate only classification metadata. Its recorded prose warning remains one; warning text is not classification proof. A capture result without sources never established classification and keeps zero prose warnings.",
    "For all four disk mutation cases calibrate a direct filesystem content-read observer against a real source read, then require zero refresh source-content reads. Preserve original saved source hash and lint ID; refresh GETs the original lint only. Empty prose_source_paths from Runtime capture must not be replaced by current disk prose."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "test-runtime-missing-schema",
      "criterion": "AC1",
      "input": {
        "files": {
          "product/plan.md": "# Plan",
          "test/runtime/order.json": "{}"
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "exit_code": 2,
        "capture_calls": 0,
        "auth_calls": 0,
        "posts": 0,
        "diagnostic_contains": [
          "test/runtime/order.json",
          "is not a PDD test file"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "test-runtime-wrong-schema",
      "criterion": "AC1",
      "input": {
        "files": {
          "product/plan.md": "# Plan",
          "test/runtime/order.json": "{\"schema_version\":\"foreign.v1\"}"
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "exit_code": 2,
        "capture_calls": 0,
        "auth_calls": 0,
        "posts": 0,
        "diagnostic_contains": [
          "test/runtime/order.json",
          "is not a PDD test file"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
